<title>POLAND: Rafako revises down H1 net profit.</title>
<headline>Rafako revises down H1 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rafako SA results for period ending June 30</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 H1 1996     H1 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     13.10  vs    17.29</p>
<p>    pre-tax				   2.49  vs    15.14</p>
<p>    net					 2.49  vs     9.89</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Raciborskie Fabryki Kotlow Rafako SA. Earlier the company reported H1 net profit of 5.06 million zlotys. @</p>
<p>    net sales			     196.61  vs   164.33</p>
<p>    costs of sales			164.25  vs   128.20</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    1.19  vs     0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				0.00  vs     5.25</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    3.85  vs     2.60</p>
<p>    financial costs			13.42  vs     4.75</p>
<p>    depreciation			    4.71  vs     2.49</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
